spes: /dev/spes-screen, a picture of the display for the Mac (0208).

User's idea, so the screen can be checked without asking. On open the device notes the address and pitch MDP VIG0 is
fetching from (SSPP SRC0_ADDR/SRC_YSTRIDE0, as SweetFramebuffer.cpp reads them); read() gives a 16-byte header (SPSC, width,
height, bytes a row) and the 1080x2400 BGRA rows. Read only; root only (0600). Made when the USB gadget starts on spes.
Mac side: tools-local/spes-screen.py (ssh cat -> PNG).

